WEBVTT

00:14.070 --> 00:17.020
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:18.200 --> 00:20.860
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:20.860 --> 00:26.260
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:27.740 --> 00:31.290
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:31.830 --> 00:36.120
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:37.080 --> 00:40.630
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:41.620 --> 00:43.830
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:43.830 --> 00:46.870
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:46.870 --> 00:48.950
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:48.950 --> 00:53.020
♪I have no regrets♪

00:53.530 --> 00:58.300
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:58.300 --> 01:02.580
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:02.580 --> 01:03.990
♪Over the time♪

01:03.990 --> 01:06.010
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:06.010 --> 01:08.860
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:08.860 --> 01:12.120
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:12.120 --> 01:16.820
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:17.530 --> 01:25.180
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:37.850 --> 01:43.210
=Sword and Fairy=

01:43.500 --> 01:46.030
=Episode 4=

01:51.520 --> 01:52.840
Such fine iron poplar wood.

01:53.200 --> 01:54.440
Thank you for making this happen, Luo.

01:54.759 --> 01:56.320
Don't mention it.

01:59.360 --> 02:00.960
Where are Yue and Little Yue?

02:03.120 --> 02:04.880
They have already set off
for Luori Village.

02:06.960 --> 02:08.400
Wasn't it agreed
that we would set off together?

02:11.880 --> 02:14.840
Probably they are angry with me.

02:15.960 --> 02:18.320
Perhaps it will just be
the two of us traveling from now on.

02:21.440 --> 02:22.040
It's alright.

02:22.200 --> 02:23.920
After all,
we are going to the same place.

02:24.040 --> 02:25.720
Maybe we'll meet them on the way.

02:39.680 --> 02:40.560
Jinzhao,

02:41.040 --> 02:44.440
didn't you say that my past
is connected with the Nine Springs?

02:44.640 --> 02:47.720
Why don't we stay
at the Luos' place to find it out?

02:48.360 --> 02:49.800
I'm afraid Luo Maiming

02:50.000 --> 02:52.360
deliberately let me
into the Octagonal Tower yesterday.

02:52.480 --> 02:53.640
Even if you are related
to the Nine Springs,

02:53.880 --> 02:55.320
he certainly won't tell us.

02:55.800 --> 02:57.280
Fortunately,
there's still a clue from Lord Ming.

02:57.400 --> 02:59.160
Following it,
we can also find out your origins.

03:00.080 --> 03:01.760
But walking to Luori Village

03:02.040 --> 03:04.520
would be too tiring, wouldn't it?

03:04.640 --> 03:06.320
I want to take a carriage,

03:06.520 --> 03:09.800
drink ice water, and eat icy fruits.

03:11.440 --> 03:13.080
You can dream on. Let's go.

03:19.920 --> 03:21.720
Yue, Little Yue, get on the carriage.

03:22.360 --> 03:22.920
Let's go.

03:23.079 --> 03:24.800
My dream has come true.

03:29.760 --> 03:31.040
I, Shifang, and Zhaoyan

03:31.160 --> 03:32.600
will all wait for you together
in Luori Village, Jinzhao.

03:32.760 --> 03:34.480
Let's see who gets there faster.

03:37.320 --> 03:38.760
Yue, you should get on quickly too.

03:45.680 --> 03:48.960
Jinzhao, why are you
wearing such a cold expression today?

03:49.079 --> 03:51.160
Is it because
you woke up too early today

03:51.280 --> 03:52.640
and haven't gotten over
your morning grumpiness?

03:53.400 --> 03:54.040
No, it's not that.

03:54.760 --> 03:56.480
It's because
Jinzhao is as tough as steel.

03:58.400 --> 03:59.600
It's all because of you.

04:00.360 --> 04:03.040
I was afraid that you'd be deceived
without knowing it.

04:07.200 --> 04:09.600
Jinzhao, are you still angry at Zhaoyan?

04:16.600 --> 04:18.320
If you are angry with him

04:18.440 --> 04:19.360
and want to ignore him,

04:19.519 --> 04:20.640
I will ignore him too.

04:21.680 --> 04:23.000
You can keep this to yourself.

04:23.080 --> 04:24.080
There's no need to speak it aloud.

04:25.640 --> 04:26.320
It's alright.

04:26.440 --> 04:27.200
I covered my mouth with my hand.

04:27.320 --> 04:28.640
They wouldn't hear it at all.

04:30.200 --> 04:30.880
Really?

04:41.320 --> 04:42.320
Luo, eat something.

04:52.200 --> 04:53.159
What are you looking at?

04:53.920 --> 04:55.240
Nothing.

04:58.000 --> 04:58.920
When we were in the carriage,

04:59.000 --> 05:00.440
you said we were on the same team.

05:00.920 --> 05:02.800
Now, seeing others eat something tasty

05:03.000 --> 05:04.240
makes you regret it.

05:05.320 --> 05:07.520
I feel a bit regretful
that I didn't get those snacks.

05:07.640 --> 05:09.520
But I don't regret
being on the same team with you.

05:14.440 --> 05:15.120
Jinzhao,

05:15.440 --> 05:17.040
why did you argue with Zhaoyan?

05:32.640 --> 05:33.400
Are you still thirsty?

05:35.200 --> 05:36.960
It is such hot weather.

05:37.080 --> 05:38.080
The sun is scorching.

05:50.560 --> 05:52.520
Yue, Little Yue, have some snacks.

05:52.880 --> 05:53.560
Thank you.

06:02.920 --> 06:03.640
Ju,

06:04.040 --> 06:05.000
let's go find a water source.

06:06.040 --> 06:06.760
The two of us?

06:07.520 --> 06:08.600
Carrying these is cumbersome.

06:08.880 --> 06:09.560
Here.

06:11.120 --> 06:11.480
Let's go.

06:11.520 --> 06:11.840
Well...

06:13.560 --> 06:14.800
Jinzhao is so clever.

06:20.600 --> 06:21.280
Zhaoyan,

06:23.520 --> 06:24.280
I'm so thirsty.

06:24.760 --> 06:25.640
Do you have any water with you?

06:28.960 --> 06:29.720
Thank you.

06:39.760 --> 06:40.880
Miss Yue, on your journey so far,

06:41.040 --> 06:42.040
you seem to always be thirsty.

06:44.040 --> 06:45.040
Jinzhao always says

06:45.159 --> 06:47.560
I'm like a fish
that can't live without water.

06:49.400 --> 06:50.400
Yue has been good to you.

06:50.920 --> 06:52.440
You have been good to me too.

06:53.360 --> 06:54.120
I...

06:56.200 --> 06:57.440
I suspect you're Lord Ming.

06:57.600 --> 06:58.680
I haven't been very nice to you.

06:59.040 --> 07:00.320
If I really were the Lord Ming,

07:00.440 --> 07:01.400
would you kill me?

07:05.880 --> 07:06.600
Yes.

07:07.640 --> 07:08.320
Sorry.

07:09.320 --> 07:11.000
It's okay. You don't need to apologize.

07:11.200 --> 07:13.920
Everyone has the right
to choose their own stance.

07:15.560 --> 07:17.400
I didn't expect you
to be so understanding.

07:17.720 --> 07:18.720
Jinzhao told me it.

07:25.400 --> 07:26.200
Beat him.

07:29.200 --> 07:30.920
Beat him hard.

07:35.440 --> 07:37.560
Being favored by the Lord Ming
is your good fortune.

07:38.440 --> 07:39.240
How dare you escape?

07:39.760 --> 07:40.400
Beat him.

07:41.320 --> 07:43.159
Beat him
until he has no strength to escape.

07:43.400 --> 07:44.400
That's outrageous.

08:01.520 --> 08:03.480
You... You...

08:05.840 --> 08:06.720
How dare you?

08:07.120 --> 08:08.360
I will surely take your life today.

08:09.080 --> 08:11.920
Lord Ming, please protect me.

08:12.040 --> 08:14.120
I am not Lord Ming. I am Yue Qi.

08:14.640 --> 08:16.080
Are you afraid
of revealing your identity?

08:16.280 --> 08:17.560
Lord Ming, it's okay.

08:17.720 --> 08:18.640
Kill all these people.

08:18.800 --> 08:20.520
Then your whereabouts won't be revealed.

08:22.480 --> 08:24.080
If anyone is to be killed,
it should be you.

08:25.080 --> 08:25.640
No.

08:26.520 --> 08:28.040
You really aren't Lord Ming.

08:28.280 --> 08:30.240
Otherwise, why would you time and again

08:30.360 --> 08:31.680
oppose us, the Holy Sect?

08:32.080 --> 08:32.799
Go get her!

09:16.960 --> 09:19.720
Abiding by nature
is the gate of righteousness.

09:20.320 --> 09:22.680
Yue, do I look like a hero this way?

09:33.400 --> 09:34.440
This way, you do.

09:35.760 --> 09:36.760
Alright, Hero Ju,

09:36.920 --> 09:37.880
it's time to find the water.

09:38.440 --> 09:40.000
Don't end up not becoming a hero,

09:40.240 --> 09:41.520
but instead die of thirst here first.

09:44.040 --> 09:45.640
Yue, what did you call me just now?

09:45.880 --> 09:46.520
Hero.

09:48.360 --> 09:53.720
Hero... I am a great hero.

10:00.720 --> 10:01.440
Yue.

10:40.240 --> 10:41.080
Gao Xiao!

10:44.040 --> 10:46.600
Yue. Yue.

10:47.920 --> 10:48.560
Yue,

10:52.440 --> 10:55.720
it doesn't seem like
there is a water source nearby.

10:59.680 --> 11:00.400
What's wrong with you?

11:01.680 --> 11:02.280
I'm not sure.

11:02.520 --> 11:03.840
I can't quite explain the feeling.

11:04.000 --> 11:04.840
I feel a bit anxious.

11:06.520 --> 11:08.240
You're worried about Little Yue,
aren't you?

11:09.720 --> 11:13.040
Indeed, Little Yue is frail

11:14.720 --> 11:16.480
and gentle,

11:18.000 --> 11:19.720
yet adorable.

11:23.240 --> 11:25.000
It's perfectly normal for you
to worry about her.

11:25.120 --> 11:27.160
However, Master Luo is reliable.

11:27.560 --> 11:28.520
You can be at ease.

11:30.200 --> 11:30.960
Hero Ju,

11:31.640 --> 11:33.080
clearly, you do not know Qi.

11:33.120 --> 11:33.600
Let's go.

11:37.880 --> 11:38.440
No.

11:39.400 --> 11:40.120
Yue!

12:01.960 --> 12:03.570
Little Yue is actually so formidable.

12:03.920 --> 12:05.080
I was arbitrary.

12:06.040 --> 12:07.080
(After consuming the Qiyuan Orb,)

12:07.840 --> 12:09.600
(the power of Qi
has increased quite a bit.)

12:22.200 --> 12:22.840
Are you okay?

12:25.080 --> 12:26.520
Shifang, keep an eye on that person.

12:26.640 --> 12:27.920
Luo, let's cooperate with each other.

12:28.080 --> 12:28.640
Okay.

12:54.680 --> 12:55.200
Qi!

13:05.160 --> 13:05.720
Are you alright?

13:08.240 --> 13:10.480
Jinzhao, I want to try Mindlink.

13:11.040 --> 13:12.800
No, you've just been injured.

13:17.440 --> 13:19.400
Jinzhao, I want to protect everyone.

13:52.960 --> 13:53.600
Qi,

13:54.440 --> 13:55.320
I can't hold on much longer.

13:56.440 --> 13:57.360
I'll hold off the giant scorpion.

13:57.680 --> 13:58.920
You all quickly look for a chance
to leave.

14:02.040 --> 14:02.480
No way.

14:03.040 --> 14:04.840
Whether it's to kill or feel,
we do it together.

14:05.080 --> 14:06.720
I won't leave you alone.

14:53.650 --> 14:55.890
(Xian Qing)

15:05.170 --> 15:07.410
(Ming Xiu, disciple of Mount Yuqing)

15:18.450 --> 15:19.520
You are so impressive.

15:20.600 --> 15:21.800
Thank you for lending a hand.

15:22.280 --> 15:23.000
Thanks.

15:41.680 --> 15:42.160
Done.

15:45.400 --> 15:46.440
It still hurts a lot.

15:47.440 --> 15:48.640
It will be better in a while.

15:48.880 --> 15:49.880
This medicine is very good.

16:07.640 --> 16:08.680
This medicine is very precious.

16:08.760 --> 16:09.680
I don't give it to just anyone.

16:11.920 --> 16:12.720
Jinzhao,

16:13.200 --> 16:15.200
does this mean you have made amends
with Zhaoyan?

16:15.640 --> 16:16.440
You're so smart.

16:18.280 --> 16:19.120
Thanks, Yue.

16:23.730 --> 16:24.960
May I have your names?

16:25.320 --> 16:25.600
I am...

16:25.720 --> 16:28.200
He is the handsome and dashing,
wise and brave,

16:28.280 --> 16:31.400
unbeatable and generous Luo,
with exceptional martial strength.

16:32.680 --> 16:33.240
I'm Luo Zhaoyan.

16:34.580 --> 16:35.720
(This aura...)

16:37.940 --> 16:39.200
(It can't be wrong.)

16:41.440 --> 16:44.960
This is the renowned head
of the Zhengwu Alliance's Jiqiao Hall,

16:45.040 --> 16:46.920
Ju Shifang.

16:51.640 --> 16:52.640
My name is Yue Qi.

16:52.840 --> 16:53.840
And I love eating egg noodles the most.

16:53.960 --> 16:54.640
That's all.

16:56.020 --> 16:57.460
Qi.

17:02.560 --> 17:05.119
This is Yue Jinzhao,
and that one is Yue Qi.

17:07.160 --> 17:07.880
I'm Ming Xiu.

17:08.319 --> 17:09.880
A name is but an external fleetness.

17:10.400 --> 17:11.440
Just like Xiu,

17:11.880 --> 17:12.800
you can call me Xian Qing.

17:14.960 --> 17:15.640
Little Shifang.

17:17.480 --> 17:18.440
Little Zhaoyan.

17:19.720 --> 17:20.560
Little Jinzhao.

17:21.520 --> 17:22.240
Little Qi.

17:22.960 --> 17:24.480
Please don't call me Little Qi.

17:24.599 --> 17:26.319
It doesn't sound cool.

17:26.440 --> 17:27.440
Just call me Little Yue.

17:28.960 --> 17:29.760
Little Yue.

17:32.040 --> 17:33.520
This place is in a remote location.

17:33.840 --> 17:35.160
Xian Qing, Miss Ming,

17:35.240 --> 17:36.480
why have you come here?

17:37.680 --> 17:39.360
Xiu is a disciple of Mount Yuqing.

17:39.680 --> 17:40.800
I am entrusted by her master

17:41.160 --> 17:42.040
to accompany her on a journey.

17:42.720 --> 17:43.440
We passed by this place.

17:44.360 --> 17:46.160
I have heard storytellers mention

17:46.520 --> 17:48.640
that Mount Yuqing

17:48.800 --> 17:50.960
is the most, most, most secretive sect
in the jianghu.

17:51.080 --> 17:54.080
And it's rare to see disciples
of Mount Yuqing in the jianghu.

17:54.240 --> 17:55.960
Little Yue,
you are really well-informed.

17:56.600 --> 17:58.960
Indeed, Mount Yuqing
has a sparse number of people.

18:00.640 --> 18:01.200
Yes.

18:02.000 --> 18:04.520
We only have two people and one dog.

18:06.080 --> 18:07.250
Between those two people,

18:07.880 --> 18:09.560
that dog is quite superfluous.

18:14.920 --> 18:15.400
By the way,

18:16.880 --> 18:18.040
why are you all here?

18:19.920 --> 18:21.120
He is the reason we came.

18:30.760 --> 18:32.360
How is it? Does the wound still hurt?

18:32.760 --> 18:33.800
It stopped hurting a while ago.

18:35.160 --> 18:36.180
It's just that...

18:38.880 --> 18:39.560
Jinzhao,

18:40.160 --> 18:43.160
in the past,
I only wanted to protect you.

18:43.640 --> 18:44.560
But just now,

18:45.080 --> 18:47.250
when I saw Zhaoyan
and the others in danger,

18:47.320 --> 18:48.800
I wanted to protect them too.

18:51.520 --> 18:52.640
It's your first time protecting others

18:52.960 --> 18:54.000
and fighting alongside them.

18:54.560 --> 18:55.200
What does it feel like?

18:59.600 --> 19:01.560
It feels warm here.

19:04.680 --> 19:05.280
Let's go.

19:05.760 --> 19:06.600
to see how Miss Ming

19:07.000 --> 19:08.080
helped that person.

19:33.520 --> 19:33.960
Sir.

19:35.840 --> 19:37.640
You startled me.

19:38.520 --> 19:39.800
Let's hurry on our way.

19:40.200 --> 19:41.160
To where?

19:41.840 --> 19:43.480
I'd very much like
to send you on your way to death.

19:45.480 --> 19:46.960
It was not easy
to bring a human sacrifice back.

19:47.240 --> 19:49.120
And it's gone again.

19:50.000 --> 19:51.000
Director Gao,

19:51.480 --> 19:53.360
haven't we already
had the rest of the human sacrifice

19:53.480 --> 19:54.600
delivered to Luori Village?

19:55.080 --> 19:56.400
So what if one is lost?

19:57.080 --> 19:57.840
It's all your fault.

19:57.960 --> 19:59.200
You are such a lazy bone

19:59.320 --> 20:00.120
and completely useless.

20:01.040 --> 20:01.360
Then...

20:02.680 --> 20:04.120
Let's counter-attack now.

20:05.120 --> 20:06.520
Counter-attack, my foot.

20:06.880 --> 20:07.600
How do we counter-attack?

20:08.400 --> 20:09.520
You can try it yourself.

20:10.680 --> 20:11.200
It doesn't matter.

20:11.800 --> 20:13.320
After all, Lord Shengxuan said

20:13.600 --> 20:15.720
he would take care
of the Luori Village matter.

20:16.440 --> 20:18.200
Let's leave here for now

20:18.320 --> 20:19.360
and recuperate.

20:20.200 --> 20:22.880
Life is like a play.
We can always start over if need be.

20:23.040 --> 20:24.160
Well said.

20:24.480 --> 20:25.120
Come on.

20:34.040 --> 20:36.000
Are you sure he was a human sacrifice

20:36.000 --> 20:36.960
abducted by the Qiyuan Sect?

20:37.520 --> 20:38.000
That's right.

20:38.800 --> 20:40.560
We've come here specially
to investigate this.

20:41.080 --> 20:43.760
Luori Village
must have a Qiyuan Sect stronghold.

20:45.080 --> 20:45.760
I see.

20:46.640 --> 20:47.760
Then Xiu and I

20:47.920 --> 20:49.560
will deal
with the Qiyuan Sect threat here

20:49.920 --> 20:51.560
before we leave.

20:53.040 --> 20:54.440
Thank you for your help.

20:54.880 --> 20:57.160
Then Qi and I
will go ahead to scout the situation.

20:57.520 --> 20:59.720
Please take good care of that person.

21:12.960 --> 21:13.680
I've heard

21:13.880 --> 21:15.660
that there is a traveling physician
named Bian Luohuan in Luori Village

21:15.660 --> 21:17.160
whose medical skills are excellent.

21:17.600 --> 21:19.000
I've treated him a bit.

21:19.160 --> 21:19.840
But you still

21:19.920 --> 21:21.680
need to get him there
as soon as possible.

21:22.220 --> 21:22.920
So,

21:23.560 --> 21:25.440
instead of worrying about
being defeated one by one by the enemy,

21:26.760 --> 21:27.840
we'd better wait for the opportunities.

21:39.050 --> 21:40.530
(Luori Village)

22:00.000 --> 22:00.560
Sir,

22:01.280 --> 22:02.360
may I ask where Physician Bian is?

22:02.680 --> 22:03.520
Physician Bian?

22:03.720 --> 22:04.920
He's treating patients
in the thatched cottage.

22:05.960 --> 22:06.600
Over there.

22:09.760 --> 22:10.240
Qi!

22:11.640 --> 22:12.560
Where is Senior Xian Qing?

22:13.480 --> 22:14.000
Him?

22:14.240 --> 22:15.760
He ate too much
and has gone for a walk to digest.

23:14.670 --> 23:16.720
(Bian Luohuan)

23:18.320 --> 23:21.080
(This person looks so familiar.)

23:24.590 --> 23:27.000
♪The name is forgotten♪

23:27.000 --> 23:29.760
Are you Physician Bian they talk about?

23:31.570 --> 23:35.210
♪The deep feelings are hidden
behind the mask♪

23:36.500 --> 23:39.340
♪Only through the eyes♪

23:40.340 --> 23:43.660
♪Who can see them clearly♪

23:45.520 --> 23:51.580
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

23:53.380 --> 23:59.840
♪Even if I cannot escape fate
in the end♪

24:01.580 --> 24:09.100
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

24:09.580 --> 24:15.280
♪Leaving love
with an unspoken explanation♪

24:15.280 --> 24:16.400
I am Bian Luohuan.

24:17.520 --> 24:18.360
My name is Yue Qi.

24:22.160 --> 24:22.760
Qi?

24:23.820 --> 24:24.400
Qi?

24:25.600 --> 24:27.560
Jinzhao, aren't you too slow?

24:27.680 --> 24:29.000
You're too fast.

24:36.240 --> 24:38.440
This is the Physician Bian
we've been looking for.

24:55.080 --> 24:55.720
Physician Bian,

24:56.680 --> 24:58.200
this patient has been invaded
by demonic poison.

24:58.360 --> 24:59.280
Please save him.

24:59.800 --> 25:00.360
It's a simple effort for me.

25:01.760 --> 25:03.720
Put the patient on the couch.

25:09.520 --> 25:11.240
The external whip wounds
are easy to treat.

25:11.720 --> 25:13.040
But the inner poison

25:13.280 --> 25:14.440
will take some effort.

25:16.000 --> 25:16.960
You've handled it properly.

25:17.760 --> 25:20.120
After I apply the acupuncture
to expel the poison, he will be fine.

25:20.240 --> 25:21.400
However, he has lost too much blood.

25:21.560 --> 25:22.720
He needs to sleep a bit more.

25:23.240 --> 25:24.080
Thank you, Physician Bian.

25:25.080 --> 25:27.120
No matter how you thank me,
I won't charge you less.

25:27.760 --> 25:28.840
How did he get injured?

25:29.360 --> 25:30.320
We were traveling here

25:30.440 --> 25:32.640
and found this man being escorted
by the Qiyuan Sect.

25:32.960 --> 25:33.960
So, we intervened to save him.

25:34.320 --> 25:35.560
Yet he was poisoned
and fell into a coma.

25:35.880 --> 25:37.760
We had no choice but to come here
to seek your treatment.

25:38.560 --> 25:39.280
I see.

25:41.440 --> 25:42.080
Jinzhao,

25:42.360 --> 25:43.880
is there a water jug here?

25:44.000 --> 25:45.040
I'm really thirsty.

25:45.840 --> 25:46.720
Hold on a little longer.

25:46.960 --> 25:47.960
I'll take you to find water in a while.

25:48.240 --> 25:49.280
It was inconsiderate of me.

25:49.800 --> 25:50.920
I'll prepare tea
for all of you right away.

26:04.340 --> 26:05.520
How amazing!

26:08.080 --> 26:10.760
Why is Little Yue's cup
different from ours?

26:11.970 --> 26:12.810
Physician Bian,

26:13.010 --> 26:14.290
we are quite thirsty as well.

26:29.090 --> 26:30.250
This water is really sweet.

26:34.610 --> 26:36.570
Physician Bian,
we need to go to the village

26:36.810 --> 26:38.170
to find a place to stay for the night.

26:38.330 --> 26:40.250
Please take care of this person for now.

26:41.650 --> 26:43.130
I am truly sorry, Physician Bian.

26:43.370 --> 26:44.290
I've also been injured.

26:44.650 --> 26:46.650
I may need to rest here for a bit.

26:47.290 --> 26:47.690
Please feel free.

27:03.890 --> 27:04.450
Let's go.

27:16.930 --> 27:19.570
Physician Bian, have we met before?

27:20.170 --> 27:20.730
Perhaps.

27:24.530 --> 27:25.450
I have an ugly appearance.

27:26.650 --> 27:27.970
It's inconvenient to show my real face.

27:29.810 --> 27:30.490
Qi,

27:31.010 --> 27:31.770
it's impolite to do so.

27:32.250 --> 27:32.650
Let's go.

27:52.410 --> 27:54.650
What's going on
with you and Physician Bian?

27:55.170 --> 27:56.610
What do you mean, 'what's going on'?

27:57.250 --> 27:58.170
Have you seen him before?

27:58.650 --> 28:00.170
If you've seen him, I have.

28:00.330 --> 28:02.490
If you haven't seen him,
I haven't seen him either.

28:07.530 --> 28:08.050
Alright, then.

28:08.330 --> 28:09.530
Let's go spread the message.

28:10.330 --> 28:11.690
I'll stay here with Zhaoyan.

28:13.250 --> 28:14.930
Are you staying for him, or...

28:17.770 --> 28:19.250
(Why am I even getting angry?)

28:19.950 --> 28:20.530
Never mind.

28:21.170 --> 28:22.050
Then, take care.

28:50.050 --> 28:51.010
I didn't expect

28:51.450 --> 28:53.290
that you,
who are usually lazy by nature,

28:53.530 --> 28:54.930
would be willing to be close to humans.

28:58.050 --> 28:58.730
Xiu

28:59.930 --> 29:02.530
Luo Zhaoyan has half of my demoic power.

29:03.090 --> 29:05.170
You've given away
so much of your cultivation.

29:05.290 --> 29:07.330
Is it strange for him
to have half of your demonic power?

29:07.890 --> 29:09.290
Xiu, you understand me so well.

29:10.010 --> 29:11.410
I'm very gratified.

29:12.890 --> 29:13.490
Could it be

29:14.530 --> 29:16.370
that he is the child from 20 years ago?

29:17.890 --> 29:18.490
Help!

29:20.090 --> 29:21.010
Help!

29:21.170 --> 29:22.030
Help!

29:25.090 --> 29:27.010
Help! Help!

30:02.610 --> 30:03.330
Human,

30:04.210 --> 30:05.250
this is a land of demons.

30:05.930 --> 30:07.250
You shouldn't be here.

30:11.210 --> 30:12.050
You are a demon as well.

30:14.970 --> 30:16.130
Then you also possess demonic power.

30:19.010 --> 30:20.970
I beg you.

30:21.210 --> 30:22.610
Lend me your demonic orb

30:22.850 --> 30:24.210
to save my daughter.

30:25.770 --> 30:26.690
I'm begging you.

30:27.370 --> 30:28.490
I'm begging you.

30:29.170 --> 30:30.250
Please.

30:30.370 --> 30:31.050
But back then,

30:31.810 --> 30:33.970
he clearly said
it was to save his daughter's life.

30:41.690 --> 30:42.130
Shifang.

30:44.890 --> 30:45.530
Where is Little Yue?

30:46.010 --> 30:47.490
She went
to see Luo and the injured person.

30:50.490 --> 30:51.090
Ma'am,

30:51.690 --> 30:52.370
we're passing through here.

30:52.730 --> 30:53.330
Are there

30:53.450 --> 30:54.890
any vacant thatched cottages
in the village?

31:01.810 --> 31:03.770
Yue,

31:04.090 --> 31:06.250
could we really startle the enemy
by asking like this?

31:07.930 --> 31:09.410
The moment
we brought people into the village,

31:09.530 --> 31:10.930
we had already startled the enemy.

31:11.010 --> 31:13.450
Only when Luori Village is rife
with rumors can we be at ease.

31:13.690 --> 31:15.130
If there isn't a single piece of news,

31:15.250 --> 31:16.810
we must be prepared.

31:20.170 --> 31:21.970
Yue, you are really well-informed.

31:23.330 --> 31:23.970
But, Yue,

31:24.690 --> 31:27.530
we don't know
if Physician Bian is good or bad.

31:27.770 --> 31:29.010
And Luo is injured.

31:29.450 --> 31:30.930
Little Yue wouldn't be in danger, right?

31:31.370 --> 31:31.930
Rest assured.

31:32.530 --> 31:33.250
Ten of you can't beat

31:33.330 --> 31:34.610
one wounded Luo Zhaoyan.

31:34.770 --> 31:35.970
And ten wounded Luo Zhaoyans

31:36.130 --> 31:38.570
can't beat one well-fed Qi.

31:40.690 --> 31:41.770
I also want one like Little Yue...

31:41.970 --> 31:43.210
What did you say?

31:43.250 --> 31:43.850
I didn't hear clearly.

31:45.410 --> 31:47.850
I said I also wanted a sister
like Little Yue.

31:49.690 --> 31:51.490
Plain noodles! Egg noodles!

31:51.610 --> 31:52.810
Sir, a bowl of egg noodles.

31:53.090 --> 31:54.170
Alright, coming right up.

32:02.770 --> 32:03.330
Sir.

32:03.970 --> 32:05.410
Can I get credit here?

32:07.850 --> 32:08.980
You have no money?

32:09.770 --> 32:11.370
If you're not eating, then hurry along.

32:11.490 --> 32:12.410
Don't hinder my business.

32:12.730 --> 32:13.330
Two bowls.

32:13.690 --> 32:14.210
Physician Bian.

32:14.490 --> 32:15.090
Here.

32:16.490 --> 32:17.530
Alright, coming right up.

32:18.610 --> 32:20.610
Physician Bian, why are you here?

32:21.250 --> 32:21.890
I'm just passing through.

32:27.250 --> 32:30.210
The jade pendant you have
is quite unique.

32:32.130 --> 32:33.450
Jinzhao gave it to me.

32:38.530 --> 32:40.650
You seem to really like fish.

32:42.090 --> 32:42.810
Yes, I do.

32:43.330 --> 32:46.130
I like them so much
that I can't bear to eat them.

32:46.930 --> 32:47.450
By the way,

32:48.650 --> 32:51.570
I also have a hair tie
with a little fish that I really like.

32:51.850 --> 32:53.730
I've worn it for three years already.

32:57.810 --> 32:58.690
Look.

33:20.130 --> 33:21.130
I like fish a lot too.

33:21.690 --> 33:24.050
I used to have a little fish at home.

33:25.290 --> 33:26.050
We grew up together.

33:29.530 --> 33:30.290
And then?

33:31.730 --> 33:32.290
And then

33:34.570 --> 33:35.650
it got lost.

33:35.770 --> 33:36.490
Got lost?

33:38.330 --> 33:39.450
Did you find it then?

33:41.090 --> 33:42.050
I couldn't find it again.

33:44.970 --> 33:46.770
You must have been very sad.

33:57.810 --> 33:59.130
Enjoy your noodles.

34:01.130 --> 34:01.770
Here.

34:16.610 --> 34:17.570
Here's an egg for you to eat.

34:19.370 --> 34:22.010
Thank you, Physician Bian.
You're really kind.

34:22.489 --> 34:23.690
If it were Jinzhao,

34:23.810 --> 34:25.690
he'd definitely have snatched my egg.

34:26.050 --> 34:27.050
That's right.

34:29.130 --> 34:30.570
Jinzhao, give it back to me.

34:30.889 --> 34:31.530
No.

34:34.449 --> 34:35.570
I still have patients to treat.

34:36.300 --> 34:37.230
Thank you, Physician Bian.

34:38.810 --> 34:39.889
Take care, Physician Bian.

34:43.770 --> 34:44.650
Why was he here too?

34:46.610 --> 34:47.170
I don't know.

34:47.290 --> 34:48.570
Maybe he was hungry too.

34:50.730 --> 34:51.690
This is really tasty.

34:52.969 --> 34:53.770
Slow down.

34:55.330 --> 34:56.489
You've got hair in your mouth.

34:58.810 --> 35:00.010
Then I'll meet up with Shifang.

35:01.330 --> 35:02.610
I won't go with you.

35:02.610 --> 35:03.570
Physician Bian gave me a lot of money,

35:03.650 --> 35:05.250
enough for me to eat many bowls.

35:07.250 --> 35:09.330
Alright, then get back soon
after you finish eating.

35:09.930 --> 35:11.810
Luo and that person are still hurt.

35:12.090 --> 35:12.610
Rest assured.

35:12.690 --> 35:14.330
I will certainly take good care of them.

35:14.530 --> 35:16.050
Okay. Slow down.

35:21.290 --> 35:22.730
Sir, another bowl, please.

35:23.650 --> 35:26.970
I wonder what there could be
in this village.

35:32.690 --> 35:33.930
Miss Shuoxuan?

35:34.210 --> 35:34.810
Shifang,

35:35.650 --> 35:36.650
how has the rumor been spread?

35:37.930 --> 35:38.810
It's just that area left.

35:39.330 --> 35:39.730
Let's go.

35:44.610 --> 35:46.370
You said the Qiyuan Sect
attacked and hurt people.

35:46.610 --> 35:47.210
Yes.

35:47.690 --> 35:48.850
But fortunately,
thanks to Physician Bian.

35:48.930 --> 35:51.050
The injured person
has already been treated by him.

35:52.890 --> 35:54.010
We have pursued the traces
all the way here.

35:54.130 --> 35:55.570
Maybe it's related to Luori Village.

35:56.210 --> 35:56.690
Sir,

35:56.890 --> 35:59.130
has there been anything unusual
in the village lately?

36:00.970 --> 36:02.170
Then I'll have to go back and ask.

36:02.490 --> 36:05.050
But there are only a few households
in our village.

36:05.170 --> 36:06.210
And everybody knows each other well.

36:07.170 --> 36:09.210
It's unlikely there are bad people here.

36:09.330 --> 36:09.930
Rest assured, sir.

36:10.050 --> 36:11.090
With us here,
there's no need to be afraid.

36:11.610 --> 36:13.250
It's just that we need to rest here
for two days

36:13.730 --> 36:14.770
and wait for the patient to get better.

36:15.050 --> 36:16.850
Are there any vacant thatched cottages
in the village?

36:17.210 --> 36:17.890
Yes, there are.

36:18.210 --> 36:20.450
There are a few empty thatched cottages
on the northwest side of the village.

36:20.650 --> 36:21.370
I'll take you there.

36:27.970 --> 36:28.930
The village head has returned.

36:30.530 --> 36:32.410
Dad, were those two young men earlier

36:32.730 --> 36:34.410
talking about the Qiyuan Sect
attacking and harming people?

36:34.690 --> 36:35.490
Yes, Zhuo.

36:36.050 --> 36:36.490
That's right.

36:36.970 --> 36:39.170
You all must be extra careful.

36:39.330 --> 36:41.250
Our village is the only one nearby.

36:41.410 --> 36:43.610
Could it be
that there are Qiyuan Sect members here?

36:44.290 --> 36:45.090
Impossible.

36:45.610 --> 36:47.770
How could there possibly be
Qiyuan Sect members in our village?

36:48.130 --> 36:48.770
Exactly.

36:49.090 --> 36:51.530
They said
the person attacked by Qiyuan Sect

36:51.650 --> 36:53.850
is recuperating
at Physician Bian's place.

36:54.130 --> 36:54.970
When he wakes up,

36:55.090 --> 36:56.570
we can just ask him.

36:56.650 --> 36:57.770
Yeah, we can.

36:57.810 --> 36:59.210
We must ask him once he's awake.

37:03.450 --> 37:04.210
Drink slowly.

37:04.930 --> 37:06.770
Here. Have something to eat.

37:09.050 --> 37:10.570
Are all these for me?

37:15.370 --> 37:17.490
Physician Bian, you are so kind.

37:18.650 --> 37:19.530
Is Physician Bian here?

37:34.330 --> 37:34.930
Miss Yue,

37:35.970 --> 37:38.010
we must be cautious and prudent
in everything we do.

37:38.170 --> 37:39.970
Especially when we are away from home...

37:40.050 --> 37:41.850
We should help each other even more

37:42.010 --> 37:43.170
and share with each other.

37:46.250 --> 37:46.810
Thank you.

37:47.850 --> 37:48.410
Miss Yue,

37:48.690 --> 37:50.490
thank you for helping me out today.

37:51.130 --> 37:53.290
No need to thank me.
That's what friends are for.

37:56.170 --> 37:56.930
Miss Yue,

37:57.930 --> 37:58.570
I'm sorry.

37:59.530 --> 38:00.810
Why do you say that?

38:02.570 --> 38:05.330
I've been suspecting all along
that you were Lord Ming.

38:05.690 --> 38:07.770
Even though Maiming said
you might not be,

38:07.930 --> 38:10.410
my suspicions
were never truly cleared away.

38:10.970 --> 38:12.530
I am not Lord Ming.

38:13.450 --> 38:14.970
Miss Yue, you are innocent and adorable.

38:15.130 --> 38:17.810
You're also brave enough
to lend a hand in times of danger.

38:17.970 --> 38:19.810
I think we've become friends.

38:21.650 --> 38:22.410
Physician Bian,

38:22.730 --> 38:25.330
is what those outsiders said true?

38:25.450 --> 38:26.970
Just give us a straight answer.

38:27.330 --> 38:28.810
We're all scared to death.

38:29.210 --> 38:30.170
Yes, Physician Bian.

38:30.450 --> 38:31.770
Just tell us.

38:31.890 --> 38:33.450
I still have the patient
waiting for treatment.

38:33.970 --> 38:35.770
It's not a solution for you
to wait outside.

38:36.210 --> 38:37.130
It would be better for you to go home.

38:37.410 --> 38:38.330
Once the patient wakes up,

38:38.850 --> 38:40.730
your questions will be answered.

38:40.810 --> 38:42.050
Village Head...

38:42.330 --> 38:42.930
That's true.

38:43.050 --> 38:43.850
Alright then, Physician Bian.

38:44.050 --> 38:45.410
We'll just wait
for the patient to wake up.

38:45.890 --> 38:46.890
Then let's go first.

38:47.450 --> 38:48.090
Let's go.

38:48.530 --> 38:49.210
We're leaving, Physician Bian.

38:50.770 --> 38:52.170
Since we're friends now,

38:52.650 --> 38:55.050
I want to tell you something.

38:56.730 --> 38:58.290
Okay, feel free to speak.

39:01.330 --> 39:04.730
I feel Physician Bian

39:05.130 --> 39:06.730
is familiar

39:06.810 --> 39:08.370
since I first saw him.

39:08.490 --> 39:09.930
He feels like Jinzhao.

39:31.180 --> 39:34.300
♪Among the old days♪

39:35.180 --> 39:38.030
♪I search for a piece of the past♪

39:39.060 --> 39:43.060
♪My pen falls devoutly,
and our minds are in harmony♪

39:43.280 --> 39:45.390
♪I'm destined♪

39:47.090 --> 39:50.240
♪To fall for you quietly♪

39:51.310 --> 39:54.290
♪Years leave no trace♪

39:55.020 --> 39:57.200
♪With moonlight as preface♪

39:57.200 --> 39:59.020
♪I write down all the memories♪

39:59.280 --> 40:01.420
♪About you♪

40:01.970 --> 40:05.200
♪Every laughter and joy
is associated with you♪

40:05.970 --> 40:09.280
♪Everything etched deeply in my heart
is about you♪

40:09.940 --> 40:11.790
♪All the scenes of the past♪

40:11.790 --> 40:14.030
♪And smiles and tears♪

40:14.030 --> 40:18.770
♪Are inscribed for happiness♪

40:19.280 --> 40:22.990
♪Over countless rivers and mountains,
I search arduously♪

40:23.280 --> 40:27.220
♪The vast valleys
give back only my echo♪

40:27.220 --> 40:29.230
♪In the tranquility of this world♪

40:29.230 --> 40:31.220
♪I find your silhouette♪

40:31.220 --> 40:35.310
♪For the rest of my life,
we never leave nor forsake♪

40:35.310 --> 40:39.090
♪With this one thought,
I search arduously♪

40:39.090 --> 40:43.340
♪For the entirety of this life,
I'll share joys and sorrows with you♪

40:44.080 --> 40:45.580
♪Amidst the vast crowd♪

40:45.580 --> 40:47.790
♪I engrave your name♪

40:47.790 --> 40:54.130
♪Do not doubt.
My heart remains constant♪

41:09.260 --> 41:12.250
♪Waiting for the wind to rise
and the rain to stop♪

41:13.300 --> 41:16.240
♪Waiting for the long-lost silence♪

41:17.260 --> 41:21.140
♪Waiting to get closer and closer
to you♪

41:21.140 --> 41:23.280
♪And gazing at the Polaris♪

41:25.070 --> 41:28.190
♪I've fallen in love silently♪

41:29.260 --> 41:32.310
♪Stories leave no trace♪

41:33.040 --> 41:35.020
♪With moonlight as preface♪

41:35.250 --> 41:37.170
♪I write down all the memories♪

41:37.170 --> 41:40.050
♪All about you♪

41:40.050 --> 41:43.450
♪Every laughter and joy
is associated with you♪

41:43.980 --> 41:45.550
♪Everything etched deeply in my heart♪

41:45.550 --> 41:47.340
♪Is about you♪

41:48.110 --> 41:49.580
♪All the scenes of the past♪

41:49.580 --> 41:51.980
♪And smiles and tears♪

41:51.980 --> 41:56.760
♪Are inscribed for happiness♪

41:57.550 --> 42:01.040
♪Over countless rivers and mountains,
I search arduously♪

42:01.230 --> 42:05.290
♪The vast valleys
give back only my echo♪

42:05.290 --> 42:07.220
♪In the tranquility of this world♪

42:07.220 --> 42:09.230
♪I find your silhouette♪

42:09.230 --> 42:13.360
♪For the rest of my life,
we never leave nor forsake♪

42:13.360 --> 42:17.270
♪With this one thought,
I search arduously♪

42:17.270 --> 42:21.480
♪For the entirety of this life,
I'll share joys and sorrows with you♪

42:22.060 --> 42:23.760
♪Amidst the vast crowd♪

42:23.760 --> 42:25.780
♪I engrave your name♪

42:25.780 --> 42:32.100
♪Do not doubt.
My heart remains constant♪
